+## Request 12: Payment terms
+**Status**: ✅ Completed and tested
+
+### What was done
+- Updated `createInvoice` to accept optional `terms` parameter
+- Support three payment term types:
+  - NET14: Due 14 days after issue date
+  - NET30: Due 30 days after issue date (default)
+  - EOM: Due on last day of issue month
+- Automatically calculates and stores `dueDate` on invoice
+- Validates terms: TERMS_INVALID for unknown values
+- Stores both `terms` and `dueDate` on invoice
+- Added TERMS_INVALID error code
+- Added 10 comprehensive tests covering:
+  - Default NET30 behavior
+  - All three term types
+  - Edge cases (month boundaries, leap years)
+  - Invalid term rejection
+
 ## Next steps
 - Add invoice persistence/retrieval
 - Add more reporting/analytics
